<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Riksbank sees yields seen at Danish level.</title>
<headline>Swedish Riksbank sees yields seen at Danish level.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's central bank said on Monday it expected long domestic yields to fall to Danish levels as the Riksbank's increased independence would lend more credibility even if Sweden did not become a member of Europe's economic and monetary union (EMU).</p>
</text>
